WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.887
Eyler usuli sodda, lekin aniqligi past.

2
00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:05.995
Bu qismda og‘ishni bir necha nuqtada olib,

3
00:00:05.995 --> 00:00:12.657
o‘rtachasini ishlatadigan usullarni ko‘ramiz: takomillashtirilgan Eyler, ya’ni Hoyn usuli,

4
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:14.803
va klassik Runge–Kutta usuli.

5
00:00:14.803 --> 00:00:19.022
Keyin katta qadam nima uchun xavfli ekanini bilib olamiz.

6
00:00:19.272 --> 00:00:22.846
Hoyn usulida avval Eyler bilan bashorat qilamiz,

7
00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:29.845
so‘ng qadam oxiridagi og‘ishni hisoblaymiz va ikki og‘ishning o‘rtachasi bilan qadam qo‘yamiz.

8
00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:36.845
RK4 to‘rtta og‘ishni oladi: boshida, ikki marta o‘rtada va oxirida, va ularni bir, ikki, ikki,

9
00:00:36.845 --> 00:00:39.302
bir vaznlari bilan o‘rtachalaydi.

10
00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:46.431
Yana y shtrix teng x plyus y, y nolda bir, h nol butun o‘ndan bir.

11
00:00:46.431 --> 00:00:48.724
RK4 da k bir teng bir.

12
00:00:48.724 --> 00:00:56.333
k ikki — o‘rta nuqtada: x nol butun yuzdan besh, y bir butun yuzdan besh,

13
00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:00.398
demak k ikki teng bir butun o‘ndan bir.

14
00:01:00.648 --> 00:01:06.588
k uch ham o‘rta nuqtada, lekin k ikki bilan hisoblanadi: bir butun mingdan bir yuz besh.

15
00:01:06.588 --> 00:01:11.178
k to‘rt qadam oxirida: bir butun o‘n mingdan ikki ming bir yuz besh.

16
00:01:11.178 --> 00:01:16.241
Vaznli o‘rtacha bilan y bir taxminan bir butun mingdan bir yuz o‘n chiqadi,

17
00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:19.886
aniq qiymatdan farqi esa o‘n milliondan ikki atrofida.

18
00:01:20.136 --> 00:01:24.103
Uchala usulni x nol butun beshda solishtiramiz.

19
00:01:24.103 --> 00:01:32.628
Qadam ikki marta kamayganda Eyler xatosi ikki, Hoyn xatosi to‘rt, RK4 xatosi o‘n olti marta kamayadi.

20
00:01:32.628 --> 00:01:35.582
Demak tartiblar bir, ikki va to‘rt.

21
00:01:35.832 --> 00:01:37.190
Endi barqarorlik.

22
00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:44.621
y shtrix teng minus lambda y uchun Eyler har qadamda y ni bir minus h lambda ga ko‘paytiradi.

23
00:01:44.621 --> 00:01:48.296
Agar h ikki bo‘lingan lambda dan katta bo‘lsa,

24
00:01:48.296 --> 00:01:54.848
bu ko‘paytuvchi moduli birdan katta va sonli yechim ishorasini almashtirib o‘sadi,

25
00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:58.603
garchi grafikdagi aniq yechim nolga so‘nsa ham.

26
00:01:58.603 --> 00:02:02.438
SciPy dagi solve ivp qadamni avtomatik tanlaydi.

27
00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:09.079
Savol: y shtrix teng minus yigirma y uchun oshkor Eyler usuli qaysi qadamda barqaror?

28
00:02:09.079 --> 00:02:12.463
Videoni to‘xtating, javobni o‘zingiz tanlang,

29
00:02:12.463 --> 00:02:17.726
so‘ng izohni o‘qing va kerak bo‘lsa darsning tegishli qismiga qayting.
